## Comprehensive Pendo Renderer Research

---

### 1. Layout-branching Selectors in CSS Files

**card.css — Row spacing per layout**

[card.css#L23-L52](file:///Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/renderers/pendo/src/css/card.css#L23-L52):
```css
/* Row spacing in Popover layout */
._pendo-row {
  margin: var(--pendo-space-0) var(--pendo-space-0)
    var(--instui-component-shared-tokens-spacing-general-space-sm);
  line-height: var(--pendo-space-0);
  padding: var(--pendo-space-0);
}

/* Row spacing in Alert layout */
[data-layout="lightboxBlank"] ._pendo-row {
  margin-bottom: var(--instui-component-shared-tokens-spacing-gap-cards-sm);
}

[data-layout="lightboxBlank"]:not([class*="instui-alert"]) ._pendo-row {
  margin-bottom: var(--instui-component-shared-tokens-spacing-gap-cards-md);
}

/* Container is declared in container.css on the banner's ._pendo-step-container-size */
@container pantoken-pendo-guide (max-width: 30em) {
  [data-layout="lightboxBlank"]:not([class*="instui-alert"]) ._pendo-row {
    margin-bottom: var(--instui-component-shared-tokens-spacing-gap-cards-sm);
  }
}

/* Close button spacing in Popover layout */
[id*="guide-components"] > :first-child ._pendo-row {
  margin-right: calc(
    var(--instui-component-base-button-gap-button-content-sm) +
      var(--instui-component-base-button-small-height)
  );
}

/* Close button spacing in Alert layout */
[data-layout="lightboxBlank"] [id*="guide-components"] > :first-child ._pendo-row {
  margin-right: calc(
    var(--instui-component-base-button-gap-button-content-sm) +
      var(--instui-component-base-button-small-height) / 2
  );
}

/* @TODO: Close button spacing in surveys */
```

**card.css — Survey spacing** [card.css#L140-L157](file:///Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/renderers/pendo/src/css/card.css#L140-L157):
```css
/* Surveys */
._pendo-guide-walkthrough_:not([data-layout="tooltipBlank"], [data-layout="lightboxBlank"]) {
  /* Some surveys don't use `._pendo-row` for spacing, so add margin to direct children that aren't rows. */
  ._pendo-step-container-styles > :is(div, form, textarea, h2):not(._pendo-row) {
    margin: var(--pendo-space-0) auto var(--instui-component-shared-tokens-spacing-general-space-sm)
      auto;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: var(--pendo-embedded-width);
  }

  ._pendo-step-container-styles > ._pendo-row {
    max-width: var(--pendo-embedded-width);
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }
}
```

