**chrome.css — Close button positioning per layout**

[chrome.css#L47-L67](file:///Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/renderers/pendo/src/css/chrome.css#L47-L67):
```css
._pendo-close-guide {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 0;
  height: var(--instui-component-base-button-small-height);
  aspect-ratio: 1;
  border-radius: var(--instui-component-base-button-border-radius);
  background-color: transparent;
  border-width: var(--pendo-space-0);
  position: absolute;
  inset-inline: auto var(--instui-component-shared-tokens-spacing-general-space-xs);
  inset-block-start: var(--instui-component-shared-tokens-spacing-general-space-xs);
  font-size: 0;
  color: var(--instui-component-icon-base-color);
  cursor: pointer;

  &::before {
    content: "";
    inline-size: var(--instui-component-icon-size-sm);
    block-size: var(--instui-component-icon-size-sm);
    background: currentColor;
    mask: var(--instui-icon-x) center / contain no-repeat;
    transform: translateY(2px);
  }
  /* ... :hover, :active, :disabled rules omitted ... */
}

[data-layout="lightboxBlank"] ._pendo-close-guide {
  inset-block-start: var(--instui-component-alert-close-button-margin-top);
  inset-inline-end: var(--instui-component-alert-close-button-margin-right);
}

:is(:scope, [class*="instui"])[data-layout="lightboxBlank"]:not([class*="instui-alert"])
  ._pendo-close-guide {
  inset-block-start: var(--instui-component-banner-close-button-margin-top);
  inset-inline-end: var(--instui-component-banner-close-button-margin-right);
}
```

