### 2. `instui-banner` Selector Search

**No exact `instui-banner` class match found.** The selector pattern is:

- **Banners** (relying on layout + `[class*="instui"]`): [container.css#L155-L165](file:///Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/renderers/pendo/src/css/container.css#L155-L165):
```css
:is(:scope, [class*="instui"])[data-layout="lightboxBlank"]:not([class*="instui-alert"])
  ._pendo-step-container-size {
  container: pantoken-pendo-guide / inline-size;
}

:is(:scope, [class*="instui"])[data-layout="lightboxBlank"]:not([class*="instui-alert"]) {
  --_banner-close-button-reserve: 0rem;
  --_banner-glyph: var(--instui-icon-lightbulb);
  --_banner-icon-background: var(--instui-component-banner-violet-icon-background);
  --_banner-icon-size: 2rem;
  /* ...banner styles... */
}
```

The `instui-banner` class does not exist. **Banners are selected by matching `[class*="instui"]` on a `lightboxBlank` guide that does NOT match `[class*="instui-alert"]`**. Alerts use `instui-alert-info`, `instui-alert-danger`, etc.

