### 6. cssdoc.jsonc Integration

[renderers/pendo/cssdoc.jsonc](file:///Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/renderers/pendo/cssdoc.jsonc):
```jsonc
{
  "$schema": "https://cssdoc.dev/cssdoc.schema.json",
  "extends": ["../../cssdoc.jsonc"],
  // Pendo CSS targets Pendo's immutable HTML via attribute selectors, not RSCSS classes.
  "modifierConvention": "bare",
  "rules": {
    "component-name-case": "off",
    // @selector declares the real attribute selector; name-not-in-css is muted while some source files
    // still carry the [class*="instui"] wrapper that the build's addScope strips at compile time.
    "name-not-in-css": "off",
    // Pendo's internal ._pendo-* chained classes aren't modifier API we document.
    "undocumented-modifier": "off"
  }
}
```

**How `@modifier` doc comments work** (from [container.css#L1-L56](file:///Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/renderers/pendo/src/css/container.css#L1-L56)):

```css
/**
 * @component pendo-container
 * @selector [class*="instui"]
 * @summary The guide container — shared root for all Pendo guide layout types.
 * @remarks [Long description of layout and colour variants] ...
 * @modifier [data-layout="lightboxBlank"] alert — Embedded alert guide; full-width with a coloured sidebar strip and status icon.
 * @modifier [data-layout="tooltipBlank"] popover — Overlay tooltip/popover guide; fixed width with optional caret.
 * @modifier ._pendo-guide-walkthrough_ survey — Survey guide; no data-layout value, auto width.
 * @modifier -info info — Informational colour variant (alert only).
 * @modifier -danger danger — Danger/error colour variant (alert only).
 * @modifier -success success — Success colour variant (alert only).
 * @modifier -warning warning — Warning colour variant (alert only).
 * @modifier instui banner — A `lightboxBlank` guide whose class contains `instui` is a violet banner by default.
 * @modifier -sea sea banner — Use the sea surface and icon swatch.
 * @modifier -megaphone megaphone — Replace the default lightbulb glyph with a megaphone.
 * @modifier -poll poll — Replace the default lightbulb glyph with a question-message glyph.
 * @modifier -canvas canvas — Replace the default lightbulb glyph with the reversed Canvas icon.
 * @modifier -parchment parchment — Replace the default lightbulb glyph with the reversed Parchment icon.
 * @modifier -mastery mastery — Replace the default lightbulb glyph with the reversed Mastery icon.
 * @modifier -learnplatform learnplatform — Replace the default lightbulb glyph with the reversed LearnPlatform icon.
 * @part ._pendo-guide-backdrop_ — Backdrop container.
 * @part ._pendo-backdrop — Fixed full-viewport overlay; display toggled by Pendo at runtime.
 * @part ._pendo-step-container-size — Positioning/sizing wrapper; stacks above the backdrop.
 * @part ._pendo-step-container-styles — The visible card dialog; styled per layout type.
 * @part .pendo-tooltip-caret — Caret fill triangle (popover/survey only); one of four directional variants.
 * @part .pendo-tooltip-caret-border — 1px-larger caret border layer drawn behind the fill (popover/survey only).
 * @pseudo ::before — Solid variant-coloured sidebar strip on `._pendo-step-container-styles` (alert only), flush with the rounded start edge.
 * @pseudo ::after — Status icon on `._pendo-step-container-styles` (alert only), masked and centred over the strip.
 * @cssproperty --_alert-color <color> — Private; the variant border/strip colour, set by the variant class.
 * @cssproperty --_alert-icon <url> — Private; the variant status icon, set by the variant class.
 * @cssproperty --caret-color <color> — Private; the caret fill colour (maps to `view-background-primary`).
 * @cssproperty --_banner-icon-background <color> — Private; the banner icon swatch colour.
 * @cssproperty --_banner-icon-size <length> — Private; the responsive banner icon swatch size.
 */
```

**cssdoc integration**: Each `@modifier` line maps to a selectable variant in the generated docs. The `modifierConvention: "bare"` setting in `cssdoc.jsonc` means modifiers are documented as bare attribute/class patterns (e.g. `[data-layout="lightboxBlank"]`, `-info`, `instui`) rather than RSCSS compounds. When the docs are generated (via `docs/scripts/build-css-api.ts`), cssdoc extracts these `@modifier`, `@part`, `@pseudo`, and `@cssproperty` annotations and renders them in the interactive API tree.

**To add a new banner variant**, update [container.css](file:///Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/renderers/pendo/src/css/container.css):
1. Add a new `@modifier -glyph-name glyph-label — Description` line in the JSDoc block.
2. Add corresponding CSS rule (e.g., `&[class*="-glyph-name"] { --_banner-glyph: var(...); }`).
3. Add a test assertion in [build.test.ts](file:///Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/renderers/pendo/tests/build.test.ts#L137) to verify the variant CSS is present.
4. Update [README.md](file:///Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/renderers/pendo/README.md#L40-L52) table with the new suffix and treatment description.
5. Run `vp check --fix` to regenerate cssdoc outputs and `vp test` to verify.

